  ('august-02', 'august-02-draft-typing', 8, 'Build It', 'typing', '{"id":"august-02-draft-typing","format":"typing","type":"typing","section":"Build It","topic":"number of times","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the number of times meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “もう100回も言いました。”.","hintJa":"回数は a hundred times のように表します。","explanation":"A complete model answer is “I’ve told you a hundred times.”. Check the key number of times expression and every short grammar word.","explanationJa":"完全な答えは「I’ve told you a hundred times.」です。number of timesの中心表現と短い文法語まで確認しましょう。","prompt":"Type the complete English sentence from memory: もう100回も言いました。","promptJa":"日本語を見て、英文を最後まで入力してください：もう100回も言いました。","accepted":["I’ve told you a hundred times."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
