  ('august-10-part-1', 'august-10-part-1-draft-dictation-2', 18, 'Listen', 'listenType', '{"id":"august-10-part-1-draft-dictation-2","format":"listenType","type":"listenType","section":"Listen","topic":"didn’t hear","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the didn’t hear meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “私はドアベルの音に気づきませんでした。”.","hintJa":"実際にその音を聞かなかった出来事を表します。","explanation":"The complete sentence is “I didn’t hear the doorbell.”. Check every small word as well as the main vocabulary.","explanationJa":"全文は「I didn’t hear the doorbell.」です。中心の単語だけでなく、短い機能語も確認しましょう。","prompt":"Type the complete sentence you hear.","promptJa":"聞こえた英文を入力してください。","audioText":"I didn’t hear the doorbell.","accepted":["I didn’t hear the doorbell."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
  ('august-10-part-1', 'august-10-part-1-draft-dictation-3', 19, 'Listen', 'listenType', '{"id":"august-10-part-1-draft-dictation-3","format":"listenType","type":"listenType","section":"Listen","topic":"phone trouble","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the phone trouble meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “回線が何度も途切れます。”.","hintJa":"cut out は音や接続が突然途切れることです。","explanation":"The complete sentence is “The connection keeps cutting out.”. Check every small word as well as the main vocabulary.","explanationJa":"全文は「The connection keeps cutting out.」です。中心の単語だけでなく、短い機能語も確認しましょう。","prompt":"Type the complete sentence you hear.","promptJa":"聞こえた英文を入力してください。","audioText":"The connection keeps cutting out.","accepted":["The connection keeps cutting out."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
  ('august-10-part-1', 'august-10-part-1-draft-speaking-1', 20, 'Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"august-10-part-1-draft-speaking-1","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Speak","topic":"appliances","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the appliances meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “冷蔵庫が動いていません。”.","hintJa":"故障や一時的な不調には isn’t working が自然です。","explanation":"Model: “The refrigerator isn’t working.” (冷蔵庫が動いていません。). Say it as one connected message, then compare with the model.","explanationJa":"お手本は「The refrigerator isn’t working.」（冷蔵庫が動いていません。）です。一つの意味のまとまりとして話し、お手本と比べましょう。","prompt":"Listen, then speak.","promptJa":"聞いてから話してみましょう。","speakText":"The refrigerator isn’t working.","speakJa":"冷蔵庫が動いていません。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
