  ('august-23', 'august-23-draft-dictation-3', 19, 'Listen', 'listenType', '{"id":"august-23-draft-dictation-3","format":"listenType","type":"listenType","section":"Listen","topic":"confusion","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the confusion meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “少し行き違いがあるようです。”.","hintJa":"confusion は名詞で、仕事の場でも柔らかく使えます。","explanation":"The complete sentence is “There seems to be some confusion.”. Check every small word as well as the main vocabulary.","explanationJa":"全文は「There seems to be some confusion.」です。中心の単語だけでなく、短い機能語も確認しましょう。","prompt":"Type the complete sentence you hear.","promptJa":"聞こえた英文を入力してください。","audioText":"There seems to be some confusion.","accepted":["There seems to be some confusion."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
  ('august-23', 'august-23-draft-speaking-1', 20, 'Speak', 'speaking', '{"id":"august-23-draft-speaking-1","format":"speaking","type":"speaking","section":"Speak","topic":"leaving work","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the leaving work meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “よい夜をお過ごしください。”.","hintJa":"退勤時の自然で簡潔な挨拶です。","explanation":"Model: “Have a good evening.” (よい夜をお過ごしください。). Say it as one connected message, then compare with the model.","explanationJa":"お手本は「Have a good evening.」（よい夜をお過ごしください。）です。一つの意味のまとまりとして話し、お手本と比べましょう。","prompt":"Listen, then speak.","promptJa":"聞いてから話してみましょう。","speakText":"Have a good evening.","speakJa":"よい夜をお過ごしください。"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
